{"synopsis":"Masuki dunia Hajun Lee, hanya seorang pengantar barang biasa yang berusaha memenuhi kebutuhan. Namun saat dia dipanggil ke Olympus untuk menerima kiriman khusus, hidupnya berubah secara tak terduga. Tiba-tiba, dia menjadi pengantar pribadi untuk para dewa, menghasilkan banyak uang dan meningkatkan perlengkapannya dengan setiap pengiriman yang berisiko. Ikuti petualangannya yang berani melalui ruang bawah tanah dan pertempuran dengan monster saat dia belajar mengakali mereka semua. Dari satu tugas ilahi ke tugas berikutnya, Hajun menghadapi semuanya dengan akal dan nyali. Tapi bisakah dia tetap menjadi pengantar barang biasa sambil juga melayani para dewa perkasa?","alternative_title":"신들의 배달기사","author":"GGULBEOM, Badanangja (바다낭자)","artist":"JAMGGYU","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"24440c4b-0e43-4141-b537-6b5f6dbb3cfe","number":"88","chapter":"88","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2025-11-30","released":"2025-11-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"0b5b47c4-b580-4371-8b27-1b7374695ce4","number":"87","chapter":"87","title":"Chapter 87","date":"2025-11-30","released":"2025-11-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"306ac219-5197-4f83-93f7-c0f440c046d3","number":"86","chapter":"86","title":"Chapter 86","date":"2025-11-30","released":"2025-11-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7d1df509-ece8-405c-9053-c5b2e50f7b42","number":"85","chapter":"85","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2025-11-01","released":"2025-11-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"eb1c8b09-86e9-4a8c-8f6f-8806e4ef5cff","number":"84","chapter":"84","title":"Chapter 84","date":"2025-10-31","released":"2025-10-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"e664ce45-76a0-4d4a-ba24-206574d5b48c","number":"83","chapter":"83","title":"Chapter 83","date":"2025-10-30","released":"2025-10-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"37015aea-c0d8-4ce9-9f33-7c72d3d9f764","number":"82","chapter":"82","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2025-10-15","released":"2025-10-15","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"c2673f68-3833-463c-bbb4-9b1e42302fa1","number":"81","chapter":"81","title":"Ch